  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-035",
    "title": "金丹之后"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_217",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "归墟盟主将一块黑色令牌递给他：“金丹之后，你可以进入总坛内层。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "玄霄宗内战暂歇的第二日，归墟盟主抵达回川城。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6264,
          "end": 6264
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他没有带随从，也没有乘坐飞舟，只穿一件旧青衫，从城外的雪路一步步走来。城门守卫想要拦截，却在看见他腰间的半枚铜环后，默默让开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6266,
          "end": 6266
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜站在城楼上等他。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6268,
          "end": 6268
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不该来。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6270,
          "end": 6270
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你也不该把陆照临带进天门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6272,
          "end": 6272
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他自己选择的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6274,
          "end": 6274
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“选择需要知道代价。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6276,
          "end": 6276
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向城内。回川城的居民仍在修补房屋，部分姓名牌恢复，部分仍是空白。天门已经闭合，却在天空留下了一道无法消散的裂缝。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6278,
          "end": 6278
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你想要什么？”叶观澜问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6280,
          "end": 6280
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主抬起头：“改写权。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6282,
          "end": 6282
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“太虚遗脉的改写权？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6284,
          "end": 6284
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是遗脉，是所有被删去记忆的归属权。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6286,
          "end": 6286
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“归墟盟想替他们决定记住什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6288,
          "end": 6288
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“总比玄霄宗继续决定更好。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6290,
          "end": 6290
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜笑了一下：“你说得和三百年前的盟主一模一样。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6292,
          "end": 6292
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为三百年前他说的是对的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6294,
          "end": 6294
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可他把名字交给了太虚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6296,
          "end": 6296
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他交的是别人的名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6298,
          "end": 6298
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城楼下传来脚步声。陆照临、顾长离和慧闻走上来。陆照临面色苍白，掌心残印被黑线缠住，金色裂纹仍在气海中缓慢扩展。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6300,
          "end": 6300
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主看向他：“你在天门里见到陆沉舟了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6302,
          "end": 6302
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“见到了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6304,
          "end": 6304
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他还完整吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6306,
          "end": 6306
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不完整。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6308,
          "end": 6308
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你还想把他带回来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6310,
          "end": 6310
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“想。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6312,
          "end": 6312
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主点头：“这就是归墟盟与玄霄宗不同的地方。我们不保证完整，只保证选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6314,
          "end": 6314
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离问：“你们的选择包括把谁交给太虚吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6316,
          "end": 6316
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主看向她颈侧的债契：“顾氏后代，你已经交过一次。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6318,
          "end": 6318
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不是顾氏的账。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6320,
          "end": 6320
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可你继承了它。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6322,
          "end": 6322
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的铜针微微抬起。叶观澜挡在两人之间：“别在城楼上动手。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6324,
          "end": 6324
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主从袖中取出一枚白色骨牌。骨牌上刻着归墟盟旧坛的地图，地图中央有一扇向内开的门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6326,
          "end": 6326
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临，归墟盟可以帮你进入天门第二层。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6328,
          "end": 6328
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“条件？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6330,
          "end": 6330
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把第二枚残印交给我们保管。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6332,
          "end": 6332
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“保管多久？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6334,
          "end": 6334
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“直到天门完全开启。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6336,
          "end": 6336
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“然后呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6338,
          "end": 6338
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“由天下各宗共同决定如何分配被归还的记忆。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6340,
          "end": 6340
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以你把我派出来送死？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6366,
          "end": 6366
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我把你派来找持印者。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6368,
          "end": 6368
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“找到之后呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6370,
          "end": 6370
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把他带回盟内。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6372,
          "end": 6372
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜将骨牌捏得发响：“我没有答应。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6374,
          "end": 6374
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主看向陆照临：“你可以现在决定。跟叶观澜走，归墟盟会替你挡住玄霄宗；拒绝，三方都会把你当成天门钥匙。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6376,
          "end": 6376
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临问：“如果我把残印给你，顾长离的债契能解除吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6378,
          "end": 6378
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可以暂时冻结。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6380,
          "end": 6380
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“暂时多久？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6382,
          "end": 6382
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“直到她的名字被天门重新识别。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6384,
          "end": 6384
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离冷声道：“换句话说，等它重新拿走我的名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6386,
          "end": 6386
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主没有否认。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6388,
          "end": 6388
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向城外。第三盏灯的光在远处山脊闪了一下，像有人在提醒他雪原仍未结束。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6390,
          "end": 6390
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不把残印交给任何一方。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6392,
          "end": 6392
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主微微眯眼：“那你想怎么做？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6394,
          "end": 6394
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“找到第三盏灯，确认陆沉舟还能留下多少，再决定门该不该开。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6396,
          "end": 6396
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你没有资格决定天下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6398,
          "end": 6398
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我也没有想决定天下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6400,
          "end": 6400
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可门会把决定推给你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6402,
          "end": 6402
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临握住无名小灯：“那就让更多人看见门里的代价。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6404,
          "end": 6404
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主忽然笑了：“你和你父亲一样。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6406,
          "end": 6406
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临抬头：“你认识他？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6408,
          "end": 6408
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临从池中走出，衣袍滴水未沾。掌心残印已经与两枚石片融合，形成一枚不完整的灰白圆盘。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6580,
          "end": 6580
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我结丹了。”他低声说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6582,
          "end": 6582
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你记得自己为什么要结丹吗？”慧闻问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6584,
          "end": 6584
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临抬头，想起父亲、顾长离、叶观澜和回川城的居民。他知道自己必须变强，却想不起最初那个让他踏上玄霄宗山道的念头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6586,
          "end": 6586
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为了找一个人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6588,
          "end": 6588
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6590,
          "end": 6590
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6592,
          "end": 6592
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他知道答案，却无法把名字说出来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6594,
          "end": 6594
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抓住他的手：“是陆沉舟。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6596,
          "end": 6596
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "名字被她说出，暗金丹丸立刻震动。陆照临胸口一阵剧痛，记忆中那张父亲的脸再次变得模糊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6598,
          "end": 6598
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我记得。”他说，“只是不能自己说。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6600,
          "end": 6600
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主将一块黑色令牌递给他：“金丹之后，你可以进入总坛内层。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6602,
          "end": 6602
        }
      }
    ],
